  "releaseNotes": "1.4.1 - fixes the assembly version; no code or wire changes.\n\nFixed:\n- The DLL reported version 0.0.0.0. It now carries the package version (AssemblyVersion, FileVersion and InformationalVersion).\n\n1.4.0 added server push, client ids, request cancellation, MaxConcurrentRequests, KeepAlive and CurrentUserOnly, all opt-in and compatible with 1.3 in both directions.\n\nFull changelog: https://github.com/hamedafzali/HRpc/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\nSamples: https://github.com/hamedafzali/HRpc/blob/main/docs/SAMPLES.md",
